---

const W = 900;
const H = 340;

function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}
---
<figure class="dsh">
  <div class="dsh-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Deterministic simulation testing: real production code runs inside a simulator that replaces the network, disk, clock and random numbers with seeded mocks. A single seed chooses every fault, so any failing run can be replayed exactly.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="t-h" data-lang-en>The same code runs twice, and the second run is identical</text><text x="20" y="24" class="t-h" data-lang-vi>Cùng một đoạn code chạy hai lần, lần hai giống hệt lần một</text>
      <rect x="20" y="70" width="230" height="180" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="135" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Real production code</text><text x="135" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Code production thật</text>
      <text x="135" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>several nodes inside</text><text x="135" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>nhiều node trong</text>
      <text x="135" y="140" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>one process, unchanged</text><text x="135" y="140" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>một process, giữ nguyên</text>
      <rect x="300" y="46" width="330" height="236" rx="8" class="box-q" />
      <text x="312" y="66" class="t-m" data-lang-en>Simulator replaces everything unpredictable</text><text x="312" y="66" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Bộ mô phỏng thay mọi thứ khó đoán</text>
      <rect x="316" y="80" width="298" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="330" y="104" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Network: drops, delays, reorders</text><text x="330" y="104" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Mạng: rớt, trễ, đảo thứ tự</text>
      <path d="M 250 160 L 311.6 103.1" class="ln" /><polygon points="316,99 313.1,106.4 308.3,101.3" class="hd" />
      <rect x="316" y="128" width="298" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="330" y="152" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Disk: slow writes, lost writes</text><text x="330" y="152" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Đĩa: ghi chậm, mất lệnh ghi</text>
      <path d="M 250 160 L 310.1 148.2" class="ln" /><polygon points="316,147 309.6,151.8 308.3,145.0" class="hd" />
      <rect x="316" y="176" width="298" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="330" y="200" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Clock: jumps and pauses</text><text x="330" y="200" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Đồng hồ: nhảy và khựng</text>
      <path d="M 250 160 L 310.7 192.2" class="ln" /><polygon points="316,195 308.0,194.7 311.3,188.6" class="hd" />
      <rect x="316" y="224" width="298" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="330" y="248" class="t-b" data-lang-en>Random numbers: seeded</text><text x="330" y="248" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Số ngẫu nhiên: gắn seed</text>
      <path d="M 250 160 L 312.3 238.3" class="ln" /><polygon points="316,243 308.8,239.5 314.2,235.2" class="hd" />
      <rect x="690" y="70" width="190" height="64" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="785" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-en>One seed</text><text x="785" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b" data-lang-vi>Một seed</text>
      <text x="785" y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>picks every fault</text><text x="785" y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>chọn mọi sự cố</text>
      <path d="M 690 102 L 622.0 102.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="616,102 623.2,98.5 623.2,105.5" class="hd" />
      <rect x="690" y="166" width="190" height="84" rx="6" class="box-r" />
      <text x="785" y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="t-r" data-lang-en>Invariant broken?</text><text x="785" y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="t-r" data-lang-vi>Vi phạm bất biến?</text>
      <text x="785" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>Replay the same seed</text><text x="785" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Chạy lại đúng seed đó</text>
      <text x="785" y="230" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-en>and debug step by step</text><text x="785" y="230" text-anchor="middle" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>và gỡ lỗi từng bước</text>
      <path d="M 785 134 L 785.0 160.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="785,166 781.5,158.8 788.5,158.8" class="hd" />
      <text x="20" y="310" class="t-m" data-lang-en>A fault storm that took a month to hit in production can be replayed in seconds on a laptop.</text><text x="20" y="310" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>Một đợt sự cố mất cả tháng mới gặp ở production có thể chạy lại trong vài giây trên laptop.</text>
      <text x="20" y="330" class="t-m" data-lang-en>FoundationDB, TigerBeetle and Antithesis build on this idea.</text><text x="20" y="330" class="t-m" data-lang-vi>FoundationDB, TigerBeetle và Antithesis đều xây trên ý tưởng này.</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Deterministic simulation testing in one picture: the code is real, the world around it is fake and repeatable.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mô phỏng tất định trong một hình: code là thật, còn thế giới xung quanh là giả và lặp lại được.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dsh { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .dsh-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dsh svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .dsh text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .dsh .t-h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dsh .t-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dsh .t-r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .dsh .t-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .dsh .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dsh .box-r { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dsh .box-d { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dsh .box-q { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .dsh .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dsh .ln-r { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dsh .ln-d { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .dsh .ln-g { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; }
  .dsh .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dsh .hd-r { fill: var(--red); }
  .dsh figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
